<title>USA: International Flavors approves share buyback.</title>
<headline>International Flavors approves share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Flavors &amp; Fragrances Inc said on Tuesday it approved the repurchase of 7.5 million outstanding shares.</p>
<p>The buyback plan is in addition to an existing program to repurchase 7.5 million shares that is nearly completed.</p>
<p>The company said the repurchased shares would be available for the employee benefits plan and for corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
